          <div class="feature-text">
            <h3>Zero-config codegen</h3>
            <p>The CLI reads your <code>@Controller</code>, <code>@Get</code>, <code>@Body</code>, <code>@Query</code>, and <code>@Param</code> decorators. No schemas, no contracts — your existing DTOs are the source of truth. Response types are inferred via <code>ReturnType&lt;import(...)&gt;</code>.</p>
