            <p>Route names are autocompleted from your controllers. <code>routeParams</code> is required when the route has dynamic segments, and typed to the exact params. Wrong route name or missing param? TypeScript error at compile time.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="feature-full reveal">
          <div class="feature-code">
            <div class="feature-code-header">
              <span>dashboard.controller.ts</span>
