          <div class="feature-text">
            <h3>Type-safe page names</h3>
            <p>The codegen scans your <code>inertia/pages/</code> directory and augments the <code>@Inertia()</code> decorator to only accept page names that actually exist. Every page name is autocompleted in your IDE. A typo like <code>'Dashbord'</code> is a compile-time error — not a blank screen in production.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="feature-full reveal">
